From b9b9849c4adddd27d60ca5bd304fcaf3ecbbc6cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Williams <213356824+q8itz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:24:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] ui: offer CAS and FSR 1 without the FidelityFX SDK; apply
 output effects live

- The spatial CAS and FSR 1 (EASU + RCAS) presenter paths only use the
  precompiled shaders in the tree, so they no longer depend on the
  FidelityFX SDK being fetched. Temporal FSR 2/3 are still only offered
  when the FidelityFX runtime is linked.
- present_effect, the CAS/FSR sharpness settings and present_dither apply
  to the presenter as soon as they change on the UI thread.
- swap_post_effect (FXAA) applies to the command processor when changed.
---
